      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please consider adding this. The song and dance of having to guess if someone is ignoring you or they just can't see your messages is so genuinely exhausting it deters me from going to public worlds and meeting new people in general. If I at least knew who could see my messages I could pick and choose who to interact with so I'm not constantly being let down that I can't participate in someone's conversation.",
